   "text": "the lid was closed and the Mac on battery, so the Mac slept and the VM froze:\ncall 4 -> 5 took 6 min, call 6 -> 7 took 83 min, and call 8 sat for 34 min\nbefore Claude Code moved it to the background. Nothing the agent did caused this.",
